(KYC VERIFICATION SERVICES AGREEMENT \(FICTIONAL SAMPLE\)) Tj T*
(Between Northwind Bank Limited \("Bank"\) and DataVerify Solutions Private Limited \("Vendor"\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Parties and effective date. This Agreement is made on 1 April 2026 between the Bank and the) Tj T*
(Vendor, each a "Party". It takes effect on signature by both Parties.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Definitions. "Customer Data" means all personal data of the Bank's customers received or) Tj T*
(generated by the Vendor under this Agreement. "Services" means the services described in clause) Tj T*
(3.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Scope of services. The Vendor shall perform customer identity and address verification for) Tj T*
(new accounts. Where a customer cannot readily produce documents, the Vendor may accept the) Tj T*
(customer's self-declaration of address in place of documentary proof to avoid onboarding) Tj T*
(delays.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. Aadhaar data. To allow quick re-verification, the Vendor shall store the complete Aadhaar) Tj T*
(number of each customer, together with a copy of the Aadhaar card, in its verification) Tj T*
(database.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Data retention and deletion. The Vendor shall retain Customer Data and KYC records for) Tj T*
(twelve \(12\) months after termination of this Agreement and shall then permanently delete them.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6. Use and sharing of data. The Vendor may share Customer Data with its affiliates and) Tj T*
(marketing partners to improve and promote its services, without further notice to customers.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(7. Audit and inspection. The Vendor shall give the Bank and the Reserve Bank of India access to) Tj T*
(its premises, systems and records for audit and inspection at any time on reasonable notice.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(8. Security incidents. The Vendor shall notify the Bank of any data breach affecting Customer) Tj T*
(Data within seventy-two \(72\) hours of becoming aware of it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(9. Data location. All Customer Data, including backups, shall be stored on servers located in) Tj T*
(India.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(10. Sub-contracting. The Vendor shall not engage any sub-contractor to process Customer Data) Tj T*
(without the prior written approval of the Bank.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(11. Governing law. This Agreement is governed by the laws of India, and the courts at Mumbai) Tj T*
(have exclusive jurisdiction.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
